## Photographs — read before publishing

The 8 images in `images/` are **stock photography**, selected to match the
business category. They are **not** photographs of Urban Cafe.

Before publishing this site publicly, either:

1. **Replace them with your own photos** (recommended). Real photos of the
   restaurant, the food and the team will always outperform stock. Keep the same
   filenames and the layout stays intact — or update the `src` attributes in
   `index.html`.
2. **Confirm the licence** of the stock source you obtained them from, and comply
   with its attribution or commercial-use terms.

The locator map (`images/map.jpg`) is rendered from OpenStreetMap data, which is
© OpenStreetMap contributors and licensed under the Open Database License
(ODbL). A "© OpenStreetMap" credit line is displayed in the page footer; please
keep it if you retain the map.

---

## Business information

Name, address, opening hours and customer reviews are drawn from the business's
public Google Maps listing and are included to make the site useful as a
starting point. Reviews are quoted as published. Update any details that change
— hours change, phone numbers change, and a stale site is worse than none.
